{"job_id":"F-76530e989041da05d073","family_id":"F-76530e989041da05d073","title":"군인유족기장령","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003030-82861-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":7,"target_id":"ab8008f212567edb8a8f4e2aea277b79fc78d109cb09332289d9d2b974a7a3e1","source_hash":"b39a52c2b26f6de6817f7c7068126cbf6ef911415e04959dc3b28777cb874860","text":"纪念阵亡士兵家属的命令"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003030-82861-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":51,"target_id":"277b680a12614229bf7d9759def63a443148fe6a5f90cb2c45f8a5d70e8c1c16","source_hash":"e74d370485efd523d87ea69f5bfd713f36a1de67e828ed044057ea1e80e468aa","text":"第一条（资格）军属奖章应授予在战斗中阵亡、在战斗中阵亡或在战斗中受伤的士兵的遗属。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003030-82861-ko","scope":"BODY","start":51,"end":252,"target_id":"a9a84c3e5380c22cf096985424f36234067b4a34494cde1f79124b64e3347b0f","source_hash":"9093b701c4d390417808939940e097d712e0a82f1c5ef8a0131ae6c2f0f02015","text":"第二条（收据顺序）\n① 军属奖章应按军人阵亡时的优先顺序授予一人，顺序为：配偶（包括事实婚姻关系中的配偶）、子女、父母、孙子女、祖父母、兄弟姐妹。<2008年1月31日修订>\n② 就第1款所述情况而言，如有多个职级相同的人员，则以年龄最大的人员职级较高。<2008年1月31日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003030-82861-ko","scope":"BODY","start":252,"end":281,"target_id":"1d89202a7168bbba68949e4fda5acde7e7c6df2da59800751464c43a6d3be153","source_hash":"349c7f32d68b6648f1ce24edcce9de5e052ec14b43f3162d68db29f7ee1e42d3","text":"第三条（格式）军属勋章的格式如附表所示。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003030-82861-ko","scope":"BODY","start":281,"end":328,"target_id":"047f55a209e62b47cb2efad945ed200440ebbafd4902a65780a154166b4ad861","source_hash":"ca9af93c7c0139aead6bc89b18c4939e9e3f4c774b310519ae9d75310156c33c","text":"第四条（证书） 获得军属勋章的人，将同时获得一份附表所示的证书。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003030-82861-ko","scope":"BODY","start":328,"end":363,"target_id":"8efa109ca071260d9dcc77cf45f9e679ccd222728e8b1863b4d332ccd12791e4","source_hash":"7dd3ac4c37fcc18b0d26cb05c04b4bf38f189045a9764330aacee7332c236be2","text":"第五条（授予权）国防部长授予军属勋章。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003030-82861-ko","scope":"BODY","start":363,"end":414,"target_id":"a878cb361d7f7f1560c1822894c38af1bad3d16a622de5c91e52edea3b3a45f2","source_hash":"65603bc92a0de03aec8f65fcf02fc215f99392c899a51964bd6ac2bed3a732ae","text":"第六条（佩戴）军属勋章应佩戴于胸前右侧，佩戴时须随身携带证书。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003030-82861-ko","scope":"BODY","start":414,"end":507,"target_id":"9c497f20fb3b488fa7b2aaecfa9b240c059cf961ca8a6d2bd6c0172b809834f4","source_hash":"ac5b3fdb21e5a5941764841d21d9816608d6c820da6bc4319e352265380719da","text":"第七条（后继者继承）  军属勋章获得者死亡或丧失佩戴资格时，第二条规定的在世家属按优先顺序继承该勋章。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003030-82861-ko","scope":"BODY","start":507,"end":637,"target_id":"16194df415930f05a439810506074daa87a42d65dcb4cf0d400bb9f8ffc6b5ed","source_hash":"398af1f3b4ea395d77f80d6c5ac8adcd934972b6586f463cb28ad58ffb3e7abe","text":"第八条（丧失资格）  如果根据第二条规定获得遗属资格的人员被判处监禁或更重的刑罚，或因再婚、收养关系无效、或被他人收养为寄养子女等原因不再符合第二条规定的遗属资格，则该遗属将丧失获得军人遗属勋章的资格。<2008年1月31日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003030-82861-ko","scope":"BODY","start":637,"end":681,"target_id":"f62635eae145a418fee6890e9b97a6678a404f220aab37897d0a291e520f6fb0","source_hash":"42f0a2ee2684caae6b0f5a3a205dccd6e46275f441130a7aa36fb32222650dcd","text":"第九条（证书的继承） 军属勋章继承时，证书也应一并继承。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003030-82861-ko","scope":"BODY","start":681,"end":725,"target_id":"3f34934f292d5ae7ead28d2c68d44972e77795e8c0fac6eb1f30b1eb9cfa45e8","source_hash":"fc54f87a7fd56c088d18fd20e9111886764190d9965dbfeae9e462be6283eb98","text":"第十条（执行规则）执行本法令所需事项，由国防部条例规定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003030-82861-ko","scope":"BODY","start":725,"end":769,"target_id":"1ae9fa455c5dba6aac24dc63990fcc91780abfdcc552b3dcbfe3eecd9e36b237","source_hash":"bc56997dc3d6f222eea8a06fb58966d2b4e1833488dfe535933570f37da75b08","text":"补充规定 <第4934号，1970年4月20日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003030-82861-ko","scope":"BODY","start":769,"end":2521,"target_id":"e759339e0360afe22bfda9822307b9762e42080d54cd00b542ff36bc333954ca","source_hash":"69622351e33b364f2520e99161fab6072d59ff29f63e47b026251f574380734c","text":"补充条款 <第20571号，2008年1月31日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n军人遗属家属纪念仪式\n[星号]                                \n\n  士兵遗属葬礼仪式                    \n\n    1. 当前金额为                        \n\n    2. 表面 - 木槿花直径 2.5 厘米           \n\n    3. 背面 - 韩国军属勋章      \n\n    4. Gua Su-Gua Su Gyeol Yu 直径 0.7 厘米（斜纹布）   \n\n    5. Yu（垂直 10 厘米）紫色狗  \n\n                宽度 4 厘米\n\n军属勋章证书\n[附件表格] <修订于 2008.1.31>                                                 \n\n  （前端）                                                                      \n\n┏━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┓\n\n┃                                                                          ┃\n\n┃何哲┃\n\n┃군인유족기장증서                                                          ┃\n\n┃                                                                          ┃\n\n┃名称：┃\n\n┃出生日期：┃\n\n┃                                                                          ┃\n\n根据《军属勋章条例》第四条规定，特此授予上述人士军属勋章证书。\n\n┃니다。 ┃\n\n┃                                                                          ┃\n\n┃                                                                          ┃\n\n┃년         월         일                                                  ┃\n\n┃                                                                          ┃\n\n┃国防部长 [印章] ┃\n\n┗━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┛\n\n  81mm×55mm（打印纸（快递）70g/㎡）                                           \n\n  （返回）                                                  \n\n┏━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┓\n\n"},{"id":"A28608-zh-00001","doc":"A28608","law_id":"kr-003030-82861-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2038757","source_hash":"810887963502c1f110e51796f1290318a00f115ef05a52612a8b0a60024f1e2f","text":"[星号]"},{"id":"A28608-zh-00002","doc":"A28608","law_id":"kr-0030